    "file": "AGENTS.md",
    "line": "The architecture of T2 Code's websocket layer (npx @t2code/cli) enables a lot of awesome remote features. These have become core to the product. Whether users are connecting directly over their local network, using Tailscale, or leaning in fully with T3 Connect (our tunnel solution, also in this repo), we need to make sure new features are properly supported."
